  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The Green Gaza project&lt;/b&gt; aims at enabling the Palestinian population to make use of the opportunities provided by a sustainable environment. The project objectives are to improve the conditions of the Palestinian ecosystems and their population (1) by reducing ecological footprint and GHGs emissions through the promotion of green circular economy and green urban areas, (2) by focusing on energy efficiency, renewable energy, and sustainable waste management, in the region of Gaza and (3) by focusing on 1 or 2 selected value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
